        "text": "Technical requirements\nThroughout this chapter, we\u2019ll be using the Linux command line to some extent. A working Linux\ndistribution, installed on either a virtual machine ( VM ) or a desktop platform, is highly recommended.\nIf you don\u2019t have one already, go back to Chapter 1 , Installing Linux , which will guide you through the\ninstallation process. Most of the commands and examples illustrated in this chapter use Ubuntu and\nFedora, but the same would apply to any other Linux platform.\nNetworking with Linux\n216",
